":"c-nanqishu-048-liuhui-complete:p007","text":"　　遭母喪去官。有至性，持喪墓下三年，食麤糲。服闋，爲寧朔將軍、晉安王征北長史、南東海太守，行南徐州事。繪雖豪俠，常惡武事，雅善博射，未嘗跨馬。兄悛之亡，朝議贈平北將軍、雍州刺史，詔書已出，繪請尚書令徐孝嗣改之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":74,"last_line":74,"raw_start":4907,"raw_end":5013,"raw_character_offsets":[4907,4908,4909,4910,4911,4912,4913,4914,4915,4916,4917,4918,4919,4920,4921,4922,4923,4924,4925,4926,4927,4928,4929,4930,4931,4932,4933,4934,4935,4936,4937,4938,4939,4940,4941,4942,4943,4944,4945,4946,4947,4948,4949,4950,4951,4952,4953,4954,4955,4956,4957,4958,4959,4960,4961,4962,4963,4964,4965,4966,4967,4968,4969,4970,4971,4972,4973,4974,4975,4976,4977,4978,4979,4980,4981,4982,4983,4984,4985,4986,4987,4988,4989,4990,4991,4992,4993,4994,4995,4996,4997,4998,4999,5000,5001,5002,5003,5004,5005,5006,5007,5008,5009,5010,5011,5012],"revision_id":1511898},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-048-liuhui-complete:p007:m0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"sw8_tlg_wtm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-048-liuhui-complete:p007:m0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"繪","kind":"person","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-048-liuhui-complete:p007:m0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"悛","kind":"person","person_id":"d7a_zcs_5bb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-048-liuhui-complete:p007:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"繪","kind":"person","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-048-liuhui-complete:p007:m0100","start":100,"end":103,"surface":"徐孝嗣","kind":"person","person_id":"tvq_5nw_rqn","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-048-liuhui-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-048","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-048-liuhui-complete-ws1511898"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:p005","text":"　　永明初，廣陵民章起之二息犯罪爭死，太守劉悛表以聞。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed